                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fe20a13a-05a8-33cf-9e37-ad3e7ddedebe",
                        "entry_id": "309e05c1-3dc9-3661-bd10-39310e19f6ce",
                        "glosses": [
                            "imię męskie"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "307843b5-0215-4e5c-bd28-c229fde9ee8a",
                                "sense_id": "fe20a13a-05a8-33cf-9e37-ad3e7ddedebe",
                                "text": "Za tydzień brat Szymona skończy dziesięć lat."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cadb4ab3-da7c-4f74-b635-f3a0eefc41c8",
                                "sense_id": "fe20a13a-05a8-33cf-9e37-ad3e7ddedebe",
                                "text": "Umówiłyśmy się z Szymonem pod dworcem."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3a21381c-617d-454d-af19-24537d0b13c7",
                        "source_entry_id": "309e05c1-3dc9-3661-bd10-39310e19f6ce",
                        "source_sense_id": "fe20a13a-05a8-33cf-9e37-ad3e7ddedebe",
                        "target_lang_word": "Simon",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Simon",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1f4b704e-828d-32f4-9b82-efd46a714d8f",
                                        "entry_id": "d7df6f76-c172-3f9e-9003-3d8fa05ff4b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Name of any of a number of men in the New Testament, notably the original name of Apostle Peter."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "430cbbd1-ba4d-4a1e-a624-8961f941c377",
                                                "sense_id": "1f4b704e-828d-32f4-9b82-efd46a714d8f",
                                                "text": "Now the names of the twelue Apoſtles are theſe: The firſt, Simon, who is called Peter, and Andrew his brother, Iames the ſonne of Zebedee, and Iohn his brother: Philip, and Bartholomew, Thomas, and Matthew the Publicane, Iames the ſonne of Alpheus, and Lebbeus, whoſe ſurname was Thaddeus: Simon the Canaanite, and Iudas Iſcariot, who alſo betrayed him."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a030fbf1-46a8-3983-9bca-1d1716f29b58",
                                        "entry_id": "d7df6f76-c172-3f9e-9003-3d8fa05ff4b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A male given name from Hebrew."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd5206cc-ac90-477d-9c33-1b7d8fd860b8",
                                                "sense_id": "a030fbf1-46a8-3983-9bca-1d1716f29b58",
                                                "text": "His first name is Simon. I wonder why his mother named him that, or it may have been his father. My own father never bothered with the naming of us, it was up to Mother and Aunt Pauline. There is Simon Peter the Apostle, of course, who was made a fisher of men by our Lord. But there is also Simple Simon. Met a pie man, going to the fair."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9813fd44-470e-3f2c-b6ca-bb0a094cf9a4",
                                        "entry_id": "d7df6f76-c172-3f9e-9003-3d8fa05ff4b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A surname originating as a patronymic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8807650e-fc36-4edf-8c70-659f3b96c16e",
                                                "sense_id": "9813fd44-470e-3f2c-b6ca-bb0a094cf9a4",
                                                "text": "Western musicians such as Peter Gabriel, Sting, Paul Simon and David Byrne"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Simon",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ca186bd2-2a1e-33cb-a16b-cf876078d7ce",
                                        "entry_id": "f5741717-fb7b-3a5b-8b45-b6039bf5f95d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative letter-case form of simon (“sixpence coin”)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1713aa44-8249-44e4-b029-4179c13ff64a",
                                                "sense_id": "ca186bd2-2a1e-33cb-a16b-cf876078d7ce",
                                                "text": "[…] I ovve Crop the Lender a Brace, and if I have a ſingle Simon to pay him, rot me: […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
